{"import_remote calls open(url) without requiring open-uri and before validating that the URL is actually http(s), which can raise at runtime and allows non-http(s) schemes if the method is called directly": 0.9555355310440063, "The origin check is incorrect: discourseUrl.indexOf(e.origin) can be bypassed via prefix/suffix tricks and also fails when discourseUrl contains a path - should compare the exact origin derived from discourseUrl to e.origin": 0.9707610011100769, "postMessage is being called with request.referer as the targetOrigin, but targetOrigin must be an origin (scheme+host+port) or '*', so passing a full referer URL can break resizing and risks breaking the JS string if the referer contains quotes": 0.9892249703407288, "Feed item HTML is imported and later rendered via raw_html without sanitization, allowing script/event-handler injection through the feed content and can also crash if i.content is nil": 0.9935186505317688, "ERB block closing tag is invalid Ruby (`end if`) and will raise a template syntax error - should just close the `if` block": 0.8436574935913086, "Sanitize is used but isn't required in the job file - without an explicit require, this can fail in some boot paths/jobs": 0.34337612986564636, "embed_url is not validated before enqueuing retrieval - if it's malformed or has a different host than embeddable_host, TopicRetriever will skip retrieval and the embed endpoint will keep rendering the loading page indefinitely (auto-reloading every 30s)": 0.9853993654251099}